o, no lyrics)  \n\n[Verse 1]  \n[Dry vocals, Intimate tone]  \n青石小巷，月影成双，  \n檐下灯笼映红墙。  \n年少执手，笑语如常，  \n却不知富贵隔两行。  \n\n[Pre-Chorus]  \n[Drums kick in, Building tension]  \n一杯浊酒难遮惆怅，  \n满腹酸楚无人讲。  \n她的嫁衣，红如霞光，  \n却刺痛我心如刀霜。  \n\n[Chorus]  \n[Full band, Emotional, Soaring vocals]  \n借酒消愁愁更愁，  \n难忘她眉眼温柔。  \n命运作梗情难留，  \n青梅竹马成断流。  \n愿来生有缘再牵手，  \n不负此生泪长流。  \n\n[Verse 2]  \n[Soft Pipa intro, Vocals with restrained sorrow]  \n送她远去，桥头话短，  \n风吹鬓乱人心寒。  \n她低语说，莫要怨叹，  \n却掩不住眼中泪斑。  \n\n[Pre-Chorus]  \n[Strings swell, Tension rises]  \n一壶老酒饮到月残，  \n醉眼模糊不见她面。  \n红妆金钗，步步生怜，  \n可叹世俗拆散良缘。  \n\n[Chorus]  \n[Full band, Emotional, Soaring vocals]  \n借酒消愁愁更愁，  \n难忘她眉眼温柔。  \n命运作梗情难留，  \n青梅竹马成断流。  \n愿来生有缘再牵手，  \n不负此生泪长流。  \n\n[Bridge]  \n[Tempo slows, Solo Erhu wails]  \n若有来世，愿为青鸟，  \n随她远走天涯海角。  \n奈何今生，梦碎天牢，  \n世人笑我痴心徒劳。  \n\n[Chorus]  \n[Full band, Emotional, Soaring vocals]  \n借酒消愁愁更愁，  \n难忘她眉眼温柔。  \n命运作梗情难留，  \n青梅竹马成断流。  \n愿来生有缘再牵手，  \n不负此生泪长流。  \n\n[Outro]  \n[Fading out, Flute solo with soft Guzheng]  \n(青石巷尽，红尘一梦...)  \n(低声吟唱，渐渐消失)"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [444.6812438964844, 1058.0003662109375], "pos": [-975.5863647460938, 305.56182861328125], "id": 4, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [5], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["Traditional Chinese Folk, Ancient Ballad, Melancholic, Mature Male Vocals, Guzheng, Erhu, Flute, Slow"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [389.742431640625, 262.23